# Gitignored files copied into every worktree Claude Code creates.
#
# .gitignore syntax. Only files that match a pattern *and* are gitignored get
# copied, so tracked files are never duplicated. Each tool loads .env from its
# own directory, so all three are listed separately — see CLAUDE.md.
#
# This covers worktrees Claude Code makes (`claude --worktree`, subagent
# isolation, desktop parallel sessions). A worktree made by hand with
# `git worktree add` is not covered; scripts/worktree-setup.sh handles that.

.env
studio/.env
web/.env
